      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "大剣闘祭の参加者に告ぐ！　以前は\n油断をしたが、今度はそうはいかん！\n我々と戦う栄誉を貴様にくれてやろう。\nダマセン岬に来い！　待っているぞ！",
        "official_en": "You! Heroic Games amateur! We let our guard down\nbefore, but this time will be different! We grant you\nthe honor of fighting us once more. We await you at\nCape Damasen!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
